pkg:Evidence_v1_48_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.48.0 (STORY-10 real partial progress: retry extended to all genuinely LLM-calling stages)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: proceeding autonomously, pursued STORY-10 using the real testing path STORY-20 unblocked. Re-read the story's own retry-extension goal against all 11 real agent functions directly: only 4 (Intent, Story Author, Build, Test) genuinely call the LLM -- corrected an unverified assumption in the original scope. Built and shipped real malformed-detection and one-retry logic for the remaining 2 stages, verified via a real, purpose-built mock server exercising both the retry-succeeds and retry-fails paths directly, then ran the full real orchestrator end-to-end confirming the live UI and pipeline continuation both behave correctly. Full 24-question regression suite: 24/24, 0 errors. Explicitly did not attempt the larger parallelization goal in the same pass -- it requires rewriting UI/admission/logging together, and the story's own prior disclosure already named an unverifiable rewrite as worse than not doing it; left open deliberately, recorded as such. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "54e3e58c080da9adde4775c4d6a20239153f82d1842911a267c4c994ab98d46f"^^xsd:string .
